<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27921" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολῐχός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>long,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχεα, δόρυ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.533
			</span></i>, al.; also of Time, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ, νοῦσος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.243
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.172
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολιχόν,</span> as
			Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.52
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχελίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archipp.
					11.3
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.914
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρυμνήσια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					10.4
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Marc.Arg.
			</span></i>); some phrases, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πλόος, δ.
				ὁδός,</span> unite both senses, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.169
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.393
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>dīrghas</i> 'long'.)</div>
